# =============================================================================
# K² FRS — Production Caddy Reverse Proxy & Automated TLS Ingress
# KU College of Engineering & Technology (KUCET), Warangal
# Conforms to V8 Production Upgrade Blueprint §12.3 (R01 & R07)
# =============================================================================

{
    email {$ACME_EMAIL:admin@kucet.ac.in}
    admin off
}

{$APP_DOMAIN:localhost} {
    # 1. Automated Security Headers
    header {
        Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload"
        X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
        X-Frame-Options "DENY"
        X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block"
        Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        Permissions-Policy "camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=()"
        -Server
    }

    # 2. API Control Plane Ingress Route
    handle /api/* {
        reverse_proxy backend-api:8000 {
            header_up Host {host}
            header_up X-Real-IP {remote_host}
            header_up X-Forwarded-For {remote_host}
            header_up X-Forwarded-Proto {scheme}
            header_up X-Correlation-ID {http.request.header.X-Correlation-ID}
        }
    }

    # 3. Direct Health & Observability Routes
    handle /health/* {
        reverse_proxy backend-api:8000 {
            header_up Host {host}
            header_up X-Real-IP {remote_host}
        }
    }

    # 4. OpenAPI Documentation
    handle /docs* {
        reverse_proxy backend-api:8000
    }
    handle /openapi.json {
        reverse_proxy backend-api:8000
    }

    # 5. Admin Console Frontend & SSR BFF
    handle {
        reverse_proxy admin-console:3000 {
            header_up Host {host}
            header_up X-Real-IP {remote_host}
            header_up X-Forwarded-For {remote_host}
            header_up X-Forwarded-Proto {scheme}
        }
    }

    # 6. Global Access Logging
    log {
        output stdout
        format json
    }
}
